ERROR at line 11: Atomic[i8] is not a valid atomic type: this call instantiates `T` with `i8`, and `wrap` puts a `T` in an `Atomic` at line 4:48; an integer of this width cannot be operated on atomically. An atomic holds `bool` or one of the integers `i32`, `i64`, `u32` and `u64` (library/concurrency.md § Atomics); to share other data across tasks use `Mutex[T]`, which can guard any type
